  "guides": [
    {
      "_id": "OfvgEB8Mm",
      "title": "Season 7 Support Cerby - Joust - CD/Defense/Aura",
      "notes": "<p>This is the build I have been using so far in Season 7. The main goal of my build is to reduce cool downs so I can effectively continue to harass the enemy team, knock them into the air and toss them somewhere favorable for my team, as well as building with defense and usually some auras to give my team a little uplift. I vary this dependant on the team we are against, so I will walk you through it the best I can.</p>",
